{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9f88bc44cdc1c5d7", "type": "tool_result", "content": "# SemanticVocoder: Bridging Audio Generation and Audio Understanding via Semantic Latents\narXiv: 2602.23333\nAuthors: Zeyu Xie, Chenxing Li, Qiao Jin, Xuenan Xu, Guanrou Yang, Wenfu Wang, Mengyue Wu, Dong Yu, Yuexian Zou\nYear: 2026 | Venue: \nTopic: vocoder\nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. SemanticVocoder directly generates waveforms from semantic latents, eliminating reliance on VAE modules and their associated negative impacts.\n  2. The text-to-audio system powered by SemanticVocoder achieves state-of-the-art performance on AudioCaps with a Fréchet Distance of 12.823 and a Fréchet Audio Distance of 1.709.\n  3. SemanticVocoder bridges audio generation and understanding by enabling both tasks to be modeled within a shared semantic latent space.\n\nTags: Vocoder, Vocoder/Diffusion", "is_error": false}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "33b340c7-5bf1-466e-ad32-0a85acb70d27", "uuid": "e8fefbb8-a23b-4384-9612-efba7fbcb0b7", "timestamp": "2026-08-07T10:43:07.566Z", "tool_use_result": {"stdout": "# SemanticVocoder: Bridging Audio Generation and Audio Understanding via Semantic Latents\narXiv: 2602.23333\nAuthors: Zeyu Xie, Chenxing Li, Qiao Jin, Xuenan Xu, Guanrou Yang, Wenfu Wang, Mengyue Wu, Dong Yu, Yuexian Zou\nYear: 2026 | Venue: \nTopic: vocoder\nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. SemanticVocoder directly generates waveforms from semantic latents, eliminating reliance on VAE modules and their associated negative impacts.\n  2. The text-to-audio system powered by SemanticVocoder achieves state-of-the-art performance on AudioCaps with a Fréchet Distance of 12.823 and a Fréchet Audio Distance of 1.709.\n  3. SemanticVocoder bridges audio generation and understanding by enabling both tasks to be modeled within a shared semantic latent space.\n\nTags: Vocoder, Vocoder/Diffusion", "stderr": "", "interrupted": false, "isImage": false, "noOutputExpected": false}}
